00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:23.710
Oh, you're back.

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:27.130
Why are my babies crying?!

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:29.760
Work harder!

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:32.510
