00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.220
It was abandoned in a park.

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:42.940
O-Old Man Crybaby?!

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:44.860
The poor thing.

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:48.740
<i>If Old Man Crybaby's here, that means...</i>

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:50.820
Hey, Ubume!

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:53.580
<i>Here we go!</i>

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:56.370
Are you the one kidnapping babies?

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.460
