00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:18.350
You rescued them?

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:23.730
<i>That's right, I rescued them!
I did nothing wrong!</i>

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:26.730
So many people are watching...

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:30.990
Hmm. When she sees babies
with no parents nearby,

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:36.450
it's in the Ubume's instincts to
kidnap and raise them.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:40.500
<i>Ubume, those babies weren't abandoned.</i>

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:44.080
Their parents are looking for them!
We're taking them back!

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:47.920
No! I'm going to raise them!

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:50.340
They're my babies!

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:52.760
Ubume!

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:56.260
