00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.600
Catchick, get the babies.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:07:59.980
Got it!

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:08.530
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:13.780
