fine and healthy.

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:35.590
I'm sure the Ubume meant no harm.

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:39.010
Let's forgive it, why don't we?

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:42.520
You should come to the GeGeGe Forest.

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:48.190
I'm no baby,
but I'll be your play partner.

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:54.150
<i>Wow! Amazing! Kitaro's so cool!</i>

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:57.410
<i>I only recently put a letter
in the Yokai Mailbox,</i>

00:08:57.530 --> 00:09:01.540
