00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.960
<i>Yokai</i> sure go for cheap these days!

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.460
Why you...!

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:37.800
I haven't said anything wrong!

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:43.470
I'm wondering if you're all fine with
<i>yokai</i> being so convenient.

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.810
It is what it is.

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:53.480
When I met Mana, I decided to
try to understand humans again.

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:57.110
To get deeply involved with them.

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:05.950
I made up my mind,
so I'll accept whatever happens.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:11.960
If there's a problem, I'll do
everything in my power to solve it.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:13.790
That's all.

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:16.050
Kitaro...

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.760
I'll have to rely on you guys.

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:20.970
Sorry, but I'd like your help.

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:22.550
Of course.

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.140
Ya can leave it to me.

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:26.720
Wally Wall.

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:32.060
Jeez, talk about Mr. Nice Guy...

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:34.730
No, Mr. Nice Yokai!

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:37.610
You're gonna regret this.

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:39.610
Mark my words!

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:49.040
<i>Wow, Kitaro's a hit!</i>

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:56.040
<i>"All the rave! Rare pictures released!</i>
Yokai<i> gallery."</i>

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:53.290
<i>If anyone has </i>yokai<i> problems,</i>
<i>send a letter to Kitaro,</i>

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:56.040
