00:11:56.170 --> 00:12:00.590
<i>Also, stories about having fun</i>
<i>playing with </i>yokai<i> are also welcome!</i>

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:04.930
<i>You can upload videos directly through</i>
<i>OMEGA's </i>yokai<i> app!</i>

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:10.020
Oh wow. Kitaro and the <i>yokai</i> are a hit.

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:14.270
<i>Yokai</i> and humans can't be friends.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:18.280
