00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:23.780
<i>Yokai</i> and humans can be friends after all!

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:26.410
If we accept each other like this...

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:28.240
<i>Oh? Huh?</i>

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.460
