but it's in critical condition!</i>

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:46.600
TENJIN DORI (CHOFU CITY)

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:51.100
UBUME

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:50.100
-<i>"Oh no..."</i>
-<i>"No passing."</i>

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:51.100
