00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:56.560
I knew about
the <i>yokai</i> that kidnaps babies.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:59.360
It's my fault for not paying attention!

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:01.400
Did you see the Ubume?

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:03.570
