00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:06.530
I'm so sorry, honey...

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:09.700
It's not your fault.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.330
It's the <i>yokai</i>'s fault.

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:15.250
They told us <i>yokai</i> are our friends...
that they're safe comrades...

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:17.960
