00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:21.210
No! It wasn't me!

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:22.840
Do you have proof?

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:26.930
You're the ones
who told me to stop doing it!

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:29.260
I've been really restraining myself.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:30.560
Really?

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:32.890
Really!

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:37.560
Hey, Kitaro! Catchick!

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:43.240
Ubume hasn't set one foot outside of
GeGeGe Forest until now.

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:48.280
I had to listen to
her complaining the whole time.

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:52.540
I didn't get a drop to drink, so I'm sure.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.370
But...

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.750
-<i>The baby found yesterday is</i>
-That was close.

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:01.880
