your lover and left the kid in the car.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:11.390
What would we do without <i>yokai</i>?

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:16.770
This is bad. The <i>yokai</i> content is all
turning into flame wars.

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:21.820
TALKING TO JOHN DOU

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:21.820
<i>Then, unfortunately, this is the end.</i>

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:25.400
<i>Begin Plan B.</i>

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:29.700
<i>Sorry, everyone! Looks like I was wrong.</i>

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:32.410
<i>Turns out </i>yokai<i> are scary.</i>

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:35.120
<i>I've really learned my lesson!</i>

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:36.580
<i>I'm really sorry!</i>

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:40.790
<i>So, to find out</i>
<i>just how dangerous </i>yokai<i> are,</i>

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:44.880
<i>I've invited an important professor
to talk!</i>

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.720
<i>They're dangerous, right?</i>

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:49.760
Yokai<i> are scary, right?</i>

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:52.890
Scary... scary...

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:52.890
SCARY <i>YOKAI</i> STORY
<i>YOKAI</i> TRUTH REVEALED

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:54.010
I'm scared...

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:54.720
SCARY TRUTH ABOUT <i>YOKAI</i>

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:55.220
I'm scared!

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:57.390
<i>Yokai</i> are scary, huh?

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.770
I thought so, too.

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:04.360
If you think about it, they're completely
different creatures from humans.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:07.110
We could never be friends, you know?

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:09.610
Hold on, guys!

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:13.660
Didn't you say you liked <i>yokai</i>
and that they're cute?

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:16.040
But, you know...

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:17.410
Right?

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:22.170
#<i>YOKAI</i> #SCARY<i>YOKAI</i>

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:36.770
<i>Cat-san, please, we have to talk!</i>

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:41.190
Then it wasn't the Ubume this time?

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:44.730
Then if you just spread the word...

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:46.440
No, Mana.

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:50.360
Just stay away from us for now.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.200
What?

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:57.950
To be honest, I feel a little responsible.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.830
With <i>yokai</i> becoming
accepted on the internet,

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:06.040
I thought maybe we could all get along.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:12.470
I thought we could form a new, different
relationship between <i>yokai</i> and humans.

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:14.600
But...

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:16.350
this is the result.

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:18.600
Cat-san...

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:25.400
I really liked that you called me that.

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:29.030
That's why I don't want to give up.

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:32.280
I want to settle this myself.

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:37.490
Since I probably have
the deepest relationship with humans...

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:40.870
I'm the one that let this happen.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.370
Then I'll help, too!

00:16:56.140 --> 00:17:00.520
Relying on that generosity is probably
what got us into this.

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:08.150
This must be an opportunity to rethink
the relationship between <i>yokai</i> and humans.

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:09.900
That's what I think.

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:17.570
